==Quests==
*Marlon randomly offers two of the following [[Desert Festival#Skull Cavern|Skull Cavern quests]] during each day of the [[Desert Festival]]:
**"Monster Hunt": He challenges the player to slay 10 [[Serpent]]s, [[Slime|Purple Slime]]s, or [[Mummy|Mummies]]. The reward is {{Price|35|Calico}}.
**"Deep Dive": He challenges the player to reach level 30 of the [[Skull Cavern]]. The reward is {{Price|50|Calico}}.
**"Treasure Hunt": He challenges the player to collect either 12 [[Omni Geode]]s or 15 [[Iridium Ore]]. The reward is {{Price|40|Calico}}.

